# Speaker fixes for preaching-schedule rows whose Preacher cell is blank.
# ------------------------------------
# Used only when the schedule has no preacher for that date and service.
#
# FORMAT:
#   date,service,speaker
#   - date is MMDDYY, matching the recording filename (e.g. 122924)
#   - service is AM or PM
#   - Lines starting with # are comments and are ignored.
#
# Example:
#   122924,AM,Pastor Joel E. Wood
#
date,service,speaker
